{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28315","headline":"赠李处士长句四韵 · 杜牧","name":"赠李处士长句四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉函怪牒锁灵篆，紫洞香风吹碧桃。\n老翁四目牙爪利，掷火万里精神高。\n霭霭祥云随步武，累累秋冢叹蓬蒿。\n三山朝去应非久，姹女当窗绣羽袍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}